      "content": "it's not just that they aren't listening though. it's that they've decided i don't matter. i look at my old friends and it's like they're living in a different dimension and i'm just this... mistake they're all trying to forget. there's no coming back from this. no matter what i do, the damage is done and the space i used to occupy is just gone. it feels so permanent.",
